                            	  3344: *************************************************************************************
                            	  3345: *
                            	  3346: * search for or create variable. this is used to automatically create a variable if
                            	  3347: * it is not found. any routines that need to create the variable call LAB_GVAR via
                            	  3348: * this point and error generation is supressed and the variable will be created
