                            	  3820: *************************************************************************************
                            	  3821: *
                            	  3822: * do this dimension size (d1) * array data size (Asptl)
                            	  3823: 
                            	  3824: * do a 16 x 32 bit multiply
                            	  3825: * d1 holds the 16 bit multiplier
                            	  3826: * Asptl holds the 32 bit multiplicand
                            	  3827: 
                            	  3828: * d0	bbbb  bbbb
                            	  3829: * d1	0000  aaaa
