01:00083280 D082            	  3843: 	ADD.l		d2,d0				* calculate result
01:00083282 6500EEB8        	  3844: 	BCS		LAB_OMER			* if overflow go do "Out of memory" error
                            	  3845: 
01:00083286 D0AB1EF0        	  3846: 	ADD.l		Asptl(a3),d0		* add original
01:0008328A 6500EEB0        	  3847: 	BCS		LAB_OMER			* if overflow go do "Out of memory" error
                            	  3848: 
01:0008328E 4E75            	  3849: 	RTS
