                            	  5626: 
01:00083B92 610000C6        	  5627: 	BSR		LAB_2831			* convert FAC1 floating to fixed
                            	  5628: 							* result in d0 and Itemp
01:00083B96 2080            	  5629: 	MOVE.l	d0,(a0)			* save in var
