                            	  5756: *************************************************************************************
                            	  5757: *
                            	  5758: * compare FAC1 with FAC2
                            	  5759: * returns d0=+1 Cb=0 if FAC1 > FAC2
                            	  5760: * returns d0= 0 Cb=0 if FAC1 = FAC2
                            	  5761: * returns d0=-1 Cb=1 if FAC1 < FAC2
                            	  5762: 
