                            	  7563: *************************************************************************************
                            	  7564: *
                            	  7565: * perform SQR()
                            	  7566: 
                            	  7567: * d0 is number to find the root of
                            	  7568: * d1 is the root result
                            	  7569: * d2 is the remainder
                            	  7570: * d3 is a counter
                            	  7571: * d4 is temp
                            	  7572: 
