                            	  7744: 							* flush remaining fraction digits
01:0008491E 6100E47C        	  7745: 	BSR		LAB_IGBY			* get next character
01:00084922 65FA            	  7746: 	BCS		LAB_2900			* loop while numeric character
                            	  7747: 
